# Keep the build context small and free of anything host-specific.
# Patterns match from the context root only, so every one that can occur inside apps/ or
# packages/ needs a **/ prefix - above all the .env files, or a laptop's secrets end up in the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
.git
.github
**/tests
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
docs
data
uploads
**/*.local.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
stack/instances
